                "text": "BOARD OF COUNTY COMMISSIONERS MORRIS COUNTY, NEW JERSEY July 22, 2026 Regular Meeting Agenda TIME: 7:00 PM Generated 7/17/2026 4:56 PM This meeting is being held in person and livestreamed via WebEx. The public is invited to attend in person or to view the meeting by following the link below or by calling in to the phone number listed below the link. Public comments are welcome in person or by submitting written comments to the Clerk of the Board, which may be read or summarized during the public portion of the meeting. Written comments may be submitted via email with the subject line “Public Comment”’ to the Clerk of the Board, Michele Reilly at mreilly@co.morris.nj.us or by mail addressed to Michele Reilly, Clerk of the Board, Morris County Board of County Commissioners, PO Box 900, Morristown, NJ 07963-0900. Emailed comments must be received at least eight (8) hours prior to the meeting. Mailed comments must be received by 4:00 p.m. the day before the meeting. WebEx viewer link: https://morriscountynj.webex.com/morriscountynj/j.php?MTID=me17b12956292a6453524952e 56681c03 Webinar password : i5jChaRFM38 (45524273 when dialing from a phone or video system) Phone number: 1-408-418-9388 Event number/Access Code: 233 068 01695 ANNOUNCEMENT Adequate notice of this meeting held the 22nd day of July, 2026 has been provided through resolution adopted by this Board on January 2, 2026 at its Stated Annual Meeting held at the Administration and Records Building, Morristown, New Jersey and by electronic mailing to the Star Ledger and the Daily Record, through posting on the County website and by filing a copy of same with the Morris County Clerk and the Clerk of this Board. ROLL CALL Stephen H. Shaw Director John Krickus Deputy Director Douglas R. Cabana Thomas J. Mastrangelo Christine Myers Tayfun Selen Deborah Smith OTHERS PRESENT Deena Leary, County Administrator; Brian Murray, Assistant County Administrator; John Napolitano, County Counsel; Staci S